Name = "Farmboy"
Description = "Farmboys are exactly what they sound like. Before heading off on adventurers, you were a simple farmboy or farmgirl, tending to another's farm, be that your parents or some other employer. Farmboys are great with animals and agriculture and have a knack for intense physical labor."
